@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Cancel leaving the team
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Teammate" as actor
box "Frontend — Mondino web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "ProfilePage" as page
  participant "LeaveTeamDialog" as dialog
  participant "ProfileStore" as store
end box
box "Backend — Mondino API" #D1FADF
  participant "ProfileController" as controller
end box
actor -> page : Choose "Remove my pin and leave Northwind"
page -> dialog : Open through CDK Dialog with the team's name
dialog --> actor : "Leave Northwind?"; focus starts on "Cancel" and is trapped in the dialog
alt Escape is pressed
  actor -> dialog : Escape
else "Cancel" is chosen
  actor -> dialog : Cancel
end
dialog --> page : Close
page -> page : Focus returns to the button that opened the dialog (L2-036)
page --> actor : Profile & Settings as it was
note over store, controller : ProfileStore.leave() is not called and no request reaches the backend. Nothing has changed.
@enduml
